WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Vibe Player keeps file, HLS, and embedded providers behind one package API.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The demo uses the same chrome and controls across every playback source.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Keyboard shortcuts, captions, seek, mute, and analytics stay provider neutral.
